# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:20
translate italian jez13_b18520d8:

    # "As I lie down to go to sleep, my cell phone starts buzzing in my pocket. I pull it out and see a text from Jez."
    "Mentre mi sdraio per andare a dormire, il mio cellulare inizia a vibrare in tasca. Lo tiro fuori e vedo un messaggio di Jez."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:27
translate italian jez13_1c825c30:

    # "She needs me? What is this about?"
    "Ha bisogno di me? Di cosa si tratta?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:30
translate italian jez13_fcdca668:

    # "I send her a text back, but I'm already standing up and getting ready to leave."
    "Le rispondo con un messaggio, ma mi sono già alzato e mi sto preparando per uscire."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:37
translate italian jez13_e4c1f4a7:

    # "By the time I'm in my car and driving to her house, she still hasn't texted me again, and I'm getting very worried."
    "Quando salgo in macchina e mi dirigo a casa sua, non mi ha ancora mandato nessun altro messaggio e comincio a preoccuparmi seriamente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:40
translate italian jez13_507bb3e8:

    # "At her house, I rush up the sidewalk and knock loudly on the door."
    "Arrivo a casa sua, corro lungo il marciapiede e busso forte alla porta."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:41
translate italian jez13_e644f7dc:

    # "I wait a few moments for a response, but there's only silence."
    "Aspetto qualche istante una risposta, ma c’è solo silenzio."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:42
translate italian jez13_f1357f96:

    # "Feeling very weird about it, I turn the handle on her door, finding it unlocked, and open it just slightly."
    "Con una sensazione di grande disagio, giro la maniglia della porta, che trovo aperta, e la socchiudo leggermente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:45
translate italian jez13_bf40788d:

    # "I peek inside. All the lights are off."
    "Sbircio all’interno. Tutte le luci sono spente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:46
translate italian jez13_1bb756e1:

    # pc "Jez?"
    pc "Jez?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:47
translate italian jez13_877b07f6:

    # "I call out, but I still don't hear any answer."
    "Chiamo, ma non sento ancora nessuna risposta."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:48
translate italian jez13_d12b4849:

    # "I can hear something inside though. Running water."
    "Sento però qualcosa dall’interno. Acqua che scorre."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:49
translate italian jez13_7dad49af:

    # pc "Jez? Are you okay?"
    pc "Jez? Stai bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:52
translate italian jez13_fcc96292:

    # "Nervous, I walk inside."
    "Nervosa, entro."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:53
translate italian jez13_0ba6f0af:

    # "Down the hall, I see a light coming from a mostly closed door. That's where the running water sound is coming from too."
    "In fondo al corridoio, vedo una luce provenire da una porta quasi chiusa. È da lì che proviene anche il rumore dell’acqua che scorre."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:54
translate italian jez13_13bdec20:

    # pc "Jez, it's [pcname]. I'm coming in."
    pc "Jez, sono [pcname]. Sto entrando."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:55
translate italian jez13_29614313:

    # pc "Is everything okay?"
    pc "Va tutto bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:56
translate italian jez13_61906623:

    # "Still no reply."
    "Ancora nessuna risposta."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:57
translate italian jez13_5689c553:

    # "When I get to the bathroom, I open the door slightly and peek in."
    "Quando arrivo in bagno, apro leggermente la porta e sbircio dentro."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:60
translate italian jez13_c5d4c21c:

    # "I find Jez, sitting on the floor of the shower, holding her head and sobbing."
    "Trovo Jez, seduta sul pavimento della doccia, che si tiene la testa tra le mani e singhiozza."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:61
translate italian jez13_9824f7a8:

    # pc "Jez, what's wrong?"
    pc "Jez, cosa c’è che non va?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:62
translate italian jez13_f8c74a4a:

    # "I rush in towards her."
    "Mi precipito verso di lei."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:66
translate italian jez13_7779e5b0:

    # "I kneel down next to her, water spraying all over me, soaking my clothing."
    "Mi inginocchio accanto a lei, l’acqua mi schizza dappertutto, inzuppandomi i vestiti."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:67
translate italian jez13_96cc75fe:

    # pc "Jez, what happened? Are you okay?"
    pc "Jez, cosa è successo? Stai bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:69
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:70
translate italian jez13_c5d023e4:

    # det "Please, just hold me. No talking."
    det "Per favore, abbracciami e basta. Non dire niente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:71
translate italian jez13_880b4aa8:

    # pc "Okay..."
    pc "Va bene..."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:74
translate italian jez13_b0b9d042:

    # "She leans into me, her body folding up on itself, crumpling like a paper ball."
    "Si appoggia a me, il suo corpo si raggomitola su se stesso, accartocciandosi come una pallina di carta."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:75
translate italian jez13_57b2ed32:

    # "She cries so hard. I've never seen anybody cry like this."
    "Piange così forte. Non ho mai visto nessuno piangere così."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:76
translate italian jez13_b3e695dd:

    # "Like a dam bursting, like she had been holding it in for so long."
    "Come una diga che crolla, come se avesse trattenuto tutto per così tanto tempo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:77
translate italian jez13_fc8296d1:

    # "Her body trembles and I just try to hug her and hold her and rub her back and assure her that everything is going to be okay."
    "Il suo corpo trema e io cerco solo di abbracciarla, stringerla, accarezzarle la schiena e rassicurarla che andrà tutto bene."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:78
translate italian jez13_a971ab79:

    # "Even though I don't know what is wrong and I have no idea if she'll ever be okay again."
    "Anche se non so cosa ci sia che non va e non ho idea se starà mai di nuovo bene."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:79
translate italian jez13_8cb501d6:

    # "I don't know how long we sit there like that, before she finally starts breathing normally and she looks up at me."
    "Non so per quanto tempo restiamo lì seduti così, prima che lei finalmente ricominci a respirare normalmente e mi guardi."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:82
translate italian jez13_2788f6e6:

    # det "I'm sorry. I got you all wet."
    det "Mi dispiace. Ti ho bagnato tutto."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:83
translate italian jez13_d4c3a46e:

    # pc "That doesn't matter. I just want to know that you're okay."
    pc "Non importa. Voglio solo sapere che stai bene."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:84
translate italian jez13_a5f1c96b:

    # det "I had a really bad day at work."
    det "Ho avuto una giornata davvero brutta al lavoro."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:85
translate italian jez13_13896d8c:

    # det "I feel like I can stand up now at least."
    det "Mi sento come se ora potessi almeno alzarmi in piedi."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:86
translate italian jez13_71091f24:

    # det "Get out of those wet clothes and I'll put them in the dryer."
    det "Togliti quei vestiti bagnati e li metterò nell’asciugatrice."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:89
translate italian jez13_19801827:

    # "I strip out of my clothes and a couple of minutes later, we're lying naked in her bed, my arms wrapped around her."
    "Mi spoglio e, un paio di minuti dopo, siamo sdraiati nudi nel suo letto, con le mie braccia avvolte intorno a lei."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:90
translate italian jez13_8892cc69:

    # pc "Do you want to talk about whatever happened?"
    pc "Vuoi parlare di quello che è successo?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:92
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_1:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_2.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_2.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:93
translate italian jez13_66e2454b:

    # det "I, uh... I see bad stuff at work all the time."
    det "Io, ehm... vedo cose brutte al lavoro tutto il tempo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:95
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_2:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_3.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_3.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:96
translate italian jez13_d62b2984:

    # det "Bad people doing bad things, you know?"
    det "Persone cattive che fanno cose brutte, capisci?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:98
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_3:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_4.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_4.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:99
translate italian jez13_cec0c1d1:

    # det "Most of the time it doesn't get to me."
    det "Il più delle volte non mi tocca."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:101
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_4:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_5.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_5.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:102
translate italian jez13_79ca3fcc:

    # det "But sometimes I see these horrible things that happen to good people."
    det "Ma a volte vedo queste cose orribili che capitano alle persone perbene."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:104
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_5:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_6.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_6.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:105
translate italian jez13_9629a00a:

    # det "To children..."
    det "Ai bambini..."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:107
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_6:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_7.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_7.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:108
translate italian jez13_edb2340e:

    # det "And I feel like this world isn't worth living in."
    det "E mi sembra che non valga la pena vivere in questo mondo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:112
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_7:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_8.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_8.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:113
translate italian jez13_5562c66c:

    # det "I saw some horrible shit at work today."
    det "Oggi al lavoro ho visto delle cose davvero orribili."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:115
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_8:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_9.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_9.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:116
translate italian jez13_518e8f66:

    # det "I thought I could hold it together."
    det "Pensavo di riuscire a tenermi insieme."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:118
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_9:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_10.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_10.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:119
translate italian jez13_1916d72b:

    # det "I came home and hugged Javi for a long time before I put him to bed."
    det "Sono tornata a casa e ho abbracciato Javi a lungo prima di metterlo a letto."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:121
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_10:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_11.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_11.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:122
translate italian jez13_502389b1:

    # det "Then when I got in the shower, something in my head snapped."
    det "Poi, quando sono entrata nella doccia, qualcosa nella mia testa si è spezzato."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:124
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_11:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_12.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_12.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:125
translate italian jez13_da2d853a:

    # det "I couldn't breathe, I couldn't stand. I just wanted to scream and cry."
    det "Non riuscivo a respirare, non riuscivo a stare in piedi. Volevo solo urlare e piangere."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:129
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_12:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_13.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_13.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:130
translate italian jez13_0bd213c2:

    # det "Thank you for coming. For being there for me."
    det "Grazie per essere venuta. Per esserci stata per me."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:131
translate italian jez13_a6a3e353:

    # pc "Of course. Do you need to talk to somebody professionally though? Or go to the hospital maybe?"
    pc "Certo. Hai bisogno di parlare con qualcuno di competente, però? O magari andare in ospedale?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:133
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_13:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_14.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_14.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:134
translate italian jez13_f9a943bd:

    # det "I think I'm okay right now. We have a trauma counselor at work. I'm seeing her tomorrow to talk about everything."
    det "Penso di stare bene adesso. Abbiamo una psicologa specializzata in traumi al lavoro. La vedrò domani per parlare di tutto."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:135
translate italian jez13_af09086d:

    # pc "That's good."
    pc "Bene."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:137
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_14:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_15.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_15.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:138
translate italian jez13_abf471b9:

    # det "Can you stay? I don't want to be alone tonight."
    det "Puoi restare? Non voglio stare da sola stanotte."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:139
translate italian jez13_1fd61d7b:

    # pc "Yeah, I can stay."
    pc "Sì, posso restare."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:142
translate italian jez13_539e05a9:

    # "I hold her like that for a long time and we don't really talk much more."
    "La stringo così per un bel po’ e non parliamo più di molto."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:143
translate italian jez13_6164b0d0:

    # "She quickly falls asleep, hard."
    "Si addormenta subito, profondamente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:144
translate italian jez13_58fa8ee0:

    # "All that crying must have exhausted her completely."
    "Tutto quel pianto deve averla sfinita completamente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:147
translate italian jez13_11b7b1de:

    # "It takes a while longer, but eventually I fall asleep too."
    "Ci vuole ancora un po’, ma alla fine mi addormento anch’io."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:151
translate italian jez13_1f5130c9:

    # "In the morning, I wake up with a hand on my shoulder."
    "Al mattino, mi sveglio con una mano sulla spalla."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:153
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_15:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_16.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_16.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:154
translate italian jez13_ccc69a9e:

    # det "Wake up, papi."
    det "Svegliati, papi."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:155
translate italian jez13_fe0bdf4c:

    # pc "Good morning."
    pc "Buongiorno."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:156
translate italian jez13_99f2649e:

    # det "I put your clothes on the bed there. They should be all dry."
    det "Ho messo i tuoi vestiti sul letto lì. Dovrebbero essere tutti asciutti."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:157
translate italian jez13_d8cdc3e9:

    # pc "Oh thanks."
    pc "Oh, grazie."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:160
translate italian jez13_c6cc6092:

    # det "My mamá is here, in the kitchen with Javi. Are you okay with meeting them?"
    det "Mia mamma è qui, in cucina con Javi. Ti va di conoscerli?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:161
translate italian jez13_0b87cffe:

    # pc "Are {i}you{/i} okay with it?"
    pc "{i}A te{/i} va bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:162
translate italian jez13_e0caa061:

    # det "Yeah, I think I am. I already told Mamá you were here."
    det "Sì, penso di sì. Ho già detto a mamma che eri qui."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:163
translate italian jez13_5069ef9a:

    # pc "Then yeah, let's do this."
    pc "Allora sì, facciamolo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:164
translate italian jez13_4b90fc82:

    # det "Good. Mamá is making revoltillo. I'm sure you'll love it."
    det "Bene. Mamma sta preparando il revoltillo. Sono sicura che ti piacerà un sacco."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:165
translate italian jez13_ff89b162:

    # pc "I don't know what that means, but it sounds delicious when you say it."
    pc "Non so cosa significhi, ma sembra delizioso quando lo dici tu."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:168
translate italian jez13_2f2eb37e:

    # det "Mamá is probably going to drill you some. It's just what she does, sorry."
    det "Probabilmente la mamma ti farà un po' di esercitazioni. È proprio il suo modo di fare, mi dispiace."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:169
translate italian jez13_8994460a:

    # pc "I think I'll be okay."
    pc "Penso che me la caverò."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:170
translate italian jez13_cac39c9b:

    # det "You'll do great. Then later, maybe I'll let you drill me a bit too."
    det "Te la caverai benissimo. E poi, più tardi, magari lascerò che anche tu mi torni un po’ la testa."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:171
translate italian jez13_c805d829:

    # pc "I like that idea."
    pc "Mi piace l’idea."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:174
translate italian jez13_bc882bad:

    # det "Javi, Mamá, I want you to meet my boyfriend, [pcname]."
    det "Javi, mamma, vi presento il mio ragazzo, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:175
translate italian jez13_d6a96c73:

    # mama "Buenos días, [pcname]."
    mama "Buenos días, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:176
translate italian jez13_cac0ee49:

    # "She turns to Javi, who has his head down, focused on eating."
    "Si gira verso Javi, che tiene la testa bassa, concentrato sul mangiare."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:177
translate italian jez13_9a0ee5c1:

    # mama "Tell him good morning, mijo."
    mama "Digli buongiorno, mijo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:178
translate italian jez13_6b030f59:

    # jav "Good morning."
    jav "Buongiorno."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:179
translate italian jez13_fe0bdf4c_1:

    # pc "Good morning."
    pc "Buongiorno."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:180
translate italian jez13_da4440c4:

    # det "Have a seat and I'll make you a plate."
    det "Siediti e ti preparo un piatto."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:183
translate italian jez13_7d92ea12:

    # "I sit down at the table in the empty chair next to Javi, while Jez walks over to the kitchen."
    "Mi siedo al tavolo sulla sedia vuota accanto a Javi, mentre Jez si dirige verso la cucina."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:184
translate italian jez13_165be96c:

    # jav "Are you living here now?"
    jav "Vivi qui adesso?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:185
translate italian jez13_d3f55d8e:

    # det "No, mijo, he's not living here. But you might see him sometimes. Is that okay?"
    det "No, mijo, non vive qui. Ma potresti vederlo ogni tanto. Ti sta bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:186
translate italian jez13_b4d9cdcc:

    # jav "I guess."
    jav "Immagino di sì."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:187
translate italian jez13_bd0e121b:

    # jav "Do you like Minecraft?"
    jav "Ti piace Minecraft?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:188
translate italian jez13_e961c690:

    # pc "I've never played it."
    pc "Non ci ho mai giocato."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:189
translate italian jez13_376c3872:

    # jav "Oh, I could show you how to play if you want."
    jav "Oh, potrei mostrarti come si gioca, se vuoi."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:190
translate italian jez13_5b20795d:

    # pc "Sure, that sounds fun."
    pc "Certo, sembra divertente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:191
translate italian jez13_9e8c872b:

    # jav "Okay, let's go!"
    jav "Ok, andiamo!"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:192
translate italian jez13_2ba8fd61:

    # det "Not right now, mijo. We're having breakfast and then you have to go to school."
    det "Non adesso, mijo. Stiamo facendo colazione e poi devi andare a scuola."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:193
translate italian jez13_bd2f8227:

    # jav "Okay, I'll show you later then."
    jav "Ok, te lo mostrerò più tardi allora."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:196
translate italian jez13_ce637d21:

    # "Jez and her mamá come to the table and Jez puts a plate of food in front of me."
    "Jez e sua mamma si avvicinano al tavolo e Jez mi mette davanti un piatto di cibo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:197
translate italian jez13_e02b004c:

    # "Before I get a chance to even look at it though, Mamá sits across from me and looks me in the eyes, like she's weighing me up."
    "Prima ancora che io abbia la possibilità di guardarlo, però, la mamma si siede di fronte a me e mi guarda negli occhi, come se mi stesse valutando."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:198
translate italian jez13_0711ba82:

    # mama "So, [pcname], how old are you?"
    mama "Allora, [pcname], quanti anni hai?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:200
translate italian jez13_c2113814:

    # pc "Twenty-two."
    pc "Ventidue."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:202
translate italian jez13_a6d70d6c:

    # mama "So young. You're younger than Jesabela."
    mama "Sei così giovane. Sei più giovane di Jesabela."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:205
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_16:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_17.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_17.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:206
translate italian jez13_8cc38855:

    # det "Ay Mamá!"
    det "Ay, mamma!"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:208
translate italian jez13_1da93989:

    # mama "Do you have a job?"
    mama "Hai un lavoro?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:210
translate italian jez13_748e9a7f:

    # pc "Yes, as an assistant at a law office."
    pc "Sì, faccio l’assistente in uno studio legale."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:212
translate italian jez13_23a217be:

    # mama "Do you have any children?"
    mama "Hai figli?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:214
translate italian jez13_4219f3ee:

    # pc "No."
    pc "No."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:216
translate italian jez13_5dc9c07e:

    # mama "Do you do drugs?"
    mama "Fai uso di droghe?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:218
translate italian jez13_4219f3ee_1:

    # pc "No."
    pc "No."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:220
translate italian jez13_af0ca811:

    # mama "Do you live with your parents?"
    mama "Vivi con i tuoi genitori?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:222
translate italian jez13_9af16977:

    # pc "I live with my [mother] at the moment."
    pc "Al momento vivo con la mia [mother]."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:224
translate italian jez13_6b1ebe90:

    # mama "How many other girlfriends do you have?"
    mama "Quante altre ragazze hai?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:227
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_17:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_17b.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_17b.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:228
translate italian jez13_5296d8b8:

    # det "Ay Mamá, be nice!"
    det "Ehi mamma, sii gentile!"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:229
translate italian jez13_5faa2282:

    # mama "Que?"
    mama "Cosa?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:230
translate italian jez13_fd390a20:

    # mama "Quiero saber acerca de este chico con el que estás saliendo."
    mama "Voglio sapere di questo ragazzo con cui esci."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:232
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_18:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_18.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_18.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:233
translate italian jez13_1e7215a5:

    # det "Ya te hablé de él. Es un buen chico y me gusta. ¿No confías en mi juicio?"
    det "Te ne ho già parlato. È un bravo ragazzo e mi piace. Non ti fidi del mio giudizio?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:234
translate italian jez13_28dfbcd6:

    # mama "No lo hiciste tan bien la primera vez."
    mama "Non te la sei cavata così bene la prima volta."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:235
translate italian jez13_1847687a:

    # det "Mamá!"
    det "Mamma!"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:237
translate italian jez13_a9618f8c:

    # mama "Do you have any brothers or sisters?"
    mama "Hai fratelli o sorelle?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:239
translate italian jez13_b0e9cb79:

    # pc "Just Suzy, my [sister]."
    pc "Solo Suzy, la mia [sister]."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:241
translate italian jez13_0acf000d:

    # mama "What are you going to school for?"
    mama "Che cosa studi all’università?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:243
translate italian jez13_04c35adf:

    # pc "Quantum physics. To be a scientist."
    pc "Fisica quantistica. Per diventare uno scienziato."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:245
translate italian jez13_36e29056:

    # det "That's enough, Mamá, the food is getting cold while you're grilling him."
    det "Basta così, mamma, il cibo si sta raffreddando mentre lo metti alla griglia."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:246
translate italian jez13_9fda17f8:

    # mama "You seem like a good boy, I suppose."
    mama "Mi sembri un bravo ragazzo, immagino."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:247
translate italian jez13_45d2cbc0:

    # det "He is. He helped me out a lot last night."
    det "Lo è. Mi ha aiutato tantissimo ieri sera."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:248
translate italian jez13_f3a75866:

    # mama "I'm sure he did."
    mama "Ne sono sicura."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:250
translate italian jez13_d41d8cd9_19:

    # voice 'voices/jez_13_20.mp3'
    voice 'voices/jez_13_20.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:251
translate italian jez13_b535f103:

    # det "Mamá! Cuida lo que dices delante de Javi."
    det "Mamma! Attenta a quello che dici davanti a Javi."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:252
translate italian jez13_c913be1a:

    # mama "No dije nada en absoluto!"
    mama "Non ho detto assolutamente nulla!"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:255
translate italian jez13_c5ef0cc4:

    # mama "If Jesabela likes you enough to introduce you to me, you must be something special."
    mama "Se Jesabela ti apprezza abbastanza da presentarti a me, devi essere davvero speciale."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:256
translate italian jez13_48aa3884:

    # mama "You just be good to her."
    mama "Tu comportati bene con lei."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:257
translate italian jez13_f31ca3be:

    # pc "Yes ma'am, I will."
    pc "Sì signora, lo farò."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:258
translate italian jez13_8faa40cf:

    # mama "No ma'am. You call me Mamá, or Ivelisse."
    mama "No signora. Chiamami Mamá, oppure Ivelisse."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:259
translate italian jez13_49e790d0:

    # jav "Or Abuelita."
    jav "Oppure Abuelita."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:262
translate italian jez13_f9207776:

    # mama "No, mi guapo, you're the only one that gets to call me abuelita."
    mama "No, mi guapo, tu sei l’unico che può chiamarmi abuelita."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:263
translate italian jez13_8d2fe2d9:

    # jav "Oh okay. Sorry, [pcname], you can't call her that."
    jav "Oh, va bene. Scusa, [pcname], non puoi chiamarla così."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:266
translate italian jez13_196bac72:

    # "We chit-chat a little more while we eat."
    "Chiacchieriamo ancora un po’ mentre mangiamo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:267
translate italian jez13_dedcdede:

    # "Ivelisse is a little intimidating, but after a while, she smiles a lot and she seems pretty funny."
    "Ivelisse mi intimidisce un po’, ma dopo un po’ sorride molto e sembra piuttosto simpatica."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:268
translate italian jez13_0ba3754f:

    # "And I can feel so much love between the three of them."
    "E riesco a percepire tantissimo affetto tra loro tre."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:271
translate italian jez13_81657b80:

    # "Javi talks a lot about school and the base that he and his friends are building in Minecraft."
    "Javi parla molto della scuola e della base che lui e i suoi amici stanno costruendo su Minecraft."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:272
translate italian jez13_c3923da8:

    # "Meanwhile, Jez looks at me with a shy smile while her foot rubs against my leg under the table."
    "Nel frattempo, Jez mi guarda con un sorriso timido mentre il suo piede mi sfiora la gamba sotto il tavolo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:275
translate italian jez13_c332134e:

    # "When we finish eating, I tell Javi and Ivelisse goodbye."
    "Quando finiamo di mangiare, saluto Javi e Ivelisse."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:276
translate italian jez13_eac1a598:

    # mama "It was very nice to meet you, [pcname]."
    mama "È stato davvero un piacere conoscerti, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:277
translate italian jez13_a7f3d1fc:

    # pc "Nice to meet you too. Thank you for the amazing breakfast."
    pc "Anche per me è stato un piacere. Grazie per la colazione fantastica."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:278
translate italian jez13_6ad487d2:

    # jav "Bye, [pcname]!"
    jav "Ciao, [pcname]!"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:279
translate italian jez13_5f653b3b:

    # pc "Bye, Javi. I'll be back for you to teach me about Minecraft sometime, okay?"
    pc "Ciao, Javi. Tornerò presto per farmi insegnare qualcosa su Minecraft, va bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:280
translate italian jez13_930b665f:

    # jav "Okay!"
    jav "Va bene!"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:283
translate italian jez13_12a645a9:

    # pc "Do you think I did okay?"
    pc "Pensi che me la sia cavata bene?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:284
translate italian jez13_e66be0b3:

    # det "You did wonderful."
    det "Sei stata bravissima."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:287
translate italian jez13_2a95c68b:

    # det "Seriously, [pcname]. Thank you for everything."
    det "Davvero, [pcname]. Grazie di tutto."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:288
translate italian jez13_a05c3ddb:

    # pc "You're welcome. Hope your day is better today."
    pc "Prego. Spero che oggi la tua giornata sia migliore."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:289
translate italian jez13_37df78b6:

    # det "It will be. I already feel so much better."
    det "Lo sarà. Mi sento già molto meglio."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:290
translate italian jez13_95715fb7:

    # det "You have a good day too. Let's spend some more time together soon, okay?"
    det "Buona giornata anche a te. Passiamo un po’ di tempo insieme presto, ok?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:291
translate italian jez13_2951ed74:

    # pc "Definitely."
    pc "Certamente."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:294
translate italian jez13_01f6f4f8:

    # "I leave her house and go home to change clothes and get my things, then head straight to school, barely getting there in time for my first class."
    "Esco da casa sua e torno a casa per cambiarmi e prendere le mie cose, poi mi dirigo subito a scuola, arrivando appena in tempo per la prima lezione."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:295
translate italian jez13_24a3ded4:

    # "The whole time, I'm thinking about my relationship with Jez."
    "Per tutto il tempo penso alla mia relazione con Jez."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:296
translate italian jez13_b509de35:

    # "She called me her boyfriend."
    "Mi ha chiamato “il suo ragazzo”."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:297
translate italian jez13_b197b664:

    # "It seems like it's starting to get pretty serious. Meeting her kid and her mom like that."
    "Sembra che la cosa stia iniziando a diventare piuttosto seria. Incontrare suo figlio e sua madre in quel modo."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:298
translate italian jez13_4e167340:

    # "I have to think about if that's something I really want or not. She's amazing, but am I really ready to commit to something like that?"
    "Devo riflettere se è davvero quello che voglio o no. Lei è fantastica, ma sono davvero pronto a impegnarmi in una cosa del genere?"

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:299
translate italian jez13_3bf96260:

    # "I'll need to decide soon. I don't want to hurt her."
    "Dovrò decidere presto. Non voglio ferirla."

# game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:300
translate italian jez13_3c440e53:

    # "And I don't want her Mamá to hurt me."
    "E non voglio che sua madre mi faccia del male."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:5
    old "Go on a few dates with Jez, including taking her out to eat at Luigi's."
    new "Esco un paio di volte con Jez, portandola anche a cena da Luigi’s."

    # game/Scenes/Jez/jez13.rpy:6
    old "Then she will send you a weird text when you are in your bedroom at night."
    new "Poi lei ti manderà uno strano messaggio quando sarai in camera tua di notte."

